fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"allocators/gstudmabufallocator.html#gst_udmabuf_allocator_get","fragment":"\n\tgst_udmabuf_allocator_get\n\n\n\tGstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator.prototype.get\n\n\n\tGstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator.get\n\nGet the GstUdmabufAllocator singleton if available.\na GstAllocator or NULL if\ngst_udmabuf_allocator_init_once did not register the allocator.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the GstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator singleton if available.\na Gst.Allocator or null if\nGstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator.prototype.init_once did not register the allocator.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nGet the GstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator singleton if available.\na Gst.Allocator or None if\nGstAllocators.UdmabufAllocator.init_once did not register the allocator.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});